{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ezTjFalY1P1795425542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有機構與三間中學合作，推出聊天機械人，有助社工及早發現需關注的個案。</p><p></p><p>基督教服務處今年4至6月，推出人工智能聊天機械人，至今有580名學生登記，當中302人曾與機械人對話。</p><p></p><p>經社工篩選後，有46個需關注對話和學業、自我管理及朋輩相處有關，而這批學生近七成原本沒有社工跟進。</p><p></p><p>機構指系統偵測到高危訊息，會即時鼓勵學生聯絡求助熱線，並轉介校內社工跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T21:41:31.842854+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:30.701320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T21:34:52.564600+00:00","content_hash":"c1f4c584bb90b49a3700be74d316e3a72efa2a70f0250df2081e1bd9f009d1a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T21:41:31.842854+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}